{"slug":"Chaos-Central-God-Mode-immortality-226202","_id":"6a94aa3aec8229c80adde9eb","title":"God Mode / immortality / Hazard Remover","game":{"_id":"6a94aa3aec8229c80adde9ea","gameId":99140640991543,"name":"Chaos Central","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":99140640991543},"features":"im lazy to edit the values so i will delete the whole script instead (should work fine and not break the game)\n\nRemove Some Hazards (mainly lasers)\nMakes You Immortal to ANY other Hazards! (Op ashh)\nEnjoy, it's full open source :D","tags":[],"script":"local StarterGui = game:GetService(\"StarterGui\")\n\nlocal platform = workspace:FindFirstChild(\"SafetyPlatform\")\n\nif platform and platform:IsA(\"BasePart\") then\n    local base = Instance.new(\"Part\")\n    base.Size = platform.Size\n    base.CFrame = platform.CFrame\n    base.Anchored = true\n    base.CanCollide = true\n    base.Transparency = 1\n    base.Parent = workspace\nend\n\nfor _, name in ipairs({\"Script\", \"SafetyPlatform\", \"SafetyNet\"}) do\n    local object = workspace:FindFirstChild(name)\n\n    if object then\n        object:Destroy()\n    end\nend\n\npcall(function()\n    StarterGui:SetCore(\"SendNotification\", {\n        Title = \"Some Lasers and Void ARE GONE\",\n        Text = \"made by gpjc.\",\n        Duration = 2\n    })\nend)","owner":{"_id":"681534e798856e99fa3c2417","username":"clan","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a8f15e2205f1120e38d6985bf0e07e207c07aba3e1cc70d36f0661e87a50d563.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/681534e798856e99fa3c2417-1791916497352.png"},"lvl":7,"status":"offline","id":"681534e798856e99fa3c2417","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a8f15e2205f1120e38d6985bf0e07e207c07aba3e1cc70d36f0661e87a50d563.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/ph